Short:        Game development link library with demo
Author:       robert.szacki@gmail.com (Robert Szacki)
Uploader:     robert szacki gmail com (Robert Szacki)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.1
Replaces:     dev/c/GameX.lha
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Distribution: Aminet

This is the second release of my game development library called GameX. It consists
of several game developing resources like:

- Screen management, 
- IFF file format management,
- Windows/Layers management,
- Animation system.

The source code is included along with the first Demonstration executable. Requires an Amiga with OS Release 3.0+.
